  "term": "progestogen",
  "definition": "In this study context, progestogen refers to the hormone component used in some oral contraceptive formulations, including pills that contain progestogen without the other compared hormone formulations. Progestogen-only contraceptives were linked here with lower olfactory performance than some other contraceptive regimens.",
